@startuml
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK TC"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title TF-A BL2 遞迴驗簽 BL33 (id=5) 與竄改攔截 (-EAUTH / -80) 時序圖

participant "bl2_load_images()\nbl2_image_load_v2.c" as BL2 #FCF3CF
participant "load_auth_image_recursive()\ncommon/bl_common.c" as REC #AED6F1
participant "auth_mod_verify_img()\ndrivers/auth/auth_mod.c" as AUTH #F5B7B1
participant "mbedTLS\ncrypto_mod" as MBED #D2B4DE
participant "DRAM @ 0x60000000\n(BL33 載入區)" as DRAM #E8F8F5

BL2 -> REC : load_auth_image(id=5 / BL33)
activate REC

REC -> REC : 查詢 parent：id=5 → id=15 → id=11 → id=7
note right of REC
  id=7 (Trusted Key Cert) 在載入 BL31 時已驗證過
  因此遞迴依序載入並驗證 id=11 → id=15 → id=5
end note

REC -> DRAM : load_image(id=11: NT_FW_KEY_CERT)
REC -> AUTH : auth_mod_verify_img(id=11)
AUTH -> MBED : 驗證 X.509 簽章 (Non-Trusted World Key)
MBED --> AUTH : OK (取出 NT_FW_KEY 公鑰)
AUTH --> REC : 0 (PASS)

REC -> DRAM : load_image(id=15: NT_FW_CONTENT_CERT)
REC -> AUTH : auth_mod_verify_img(id=15)
AUTH -> MBED : 驗證 X.509 簽章 (NT_FW_KEY)
MBED --> AUTH : OK (取出 BL33 預期 SHA-256 Hash)
AUTH --> REC : 0 (PASS)

REC -> DRAM : load_image(id=5: BL33 U-Boot, 0xFFDD8 bytes)
note right of DRAM
  正常實驗：資料完整
  竄改實驗：0x10FD09 處 0x00 → 0xFF
end note

REC -> AUTH : auth_mod_verify_img(id=5)
AUTH -> MBED : auth_hash() 計算並比對 SHA-256

alt 正常開機 (未竄改)
  MBED --> AUTH : Hash 吻合 (0)
  AUTH --> REC : 0 (PASS)
  REC --> BL2 : 0 → 繼續跳轉 BL31 → OP-TEE → U-Boot
else 竄改實驗 (翻轉 1 byte)
  MBED --> AUTH : Hash 不符 (非 0)
  AUTH --> REC : 驗證失敗
  REC -> DRAM : zero_normalmem() + flush_dcache_range()\n立即清零 DRAM 內的惡意映像！
  REC --> BL2 : 回傳 -EAUTH (-80)
  BL2 -> BL2 : 印出 ERROR: BL2: Failed to load image id 5 (-80)\n呼叫 plat_error_handler(-80) → Panic 停機
end

deactivate REC
@enduml
